     "The local (or marginal) precision is not the degree of smoothness. If \r<br>you think about the degree of differentiability as a degree of \r<br>smoothness, any rw1 is equally smooth. You can play with rw2 instead, \r<br>which models the second order differences.\r<br>\r<br>Elias\r<br>\r<br>"
    ]
   ]
